ous system</article-title><source>Handbook of clinical neurology Infections of the nervous system Part III</source><year>1978</year><volume>35</volume><publisher-name>Amsterdam: North-Holland Publishing Company</publisher-name><fpage>161</fpage><lpage>173</lpage><comment>(Volume 35 edited in collaboration with HL Klawans)</comment></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bonnet</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>R&#x000e9;flexions sur un cas de m&#x000e9;ningite aigu&#x000eb; &#x000e0; <italic>Microfilaria loa</italic></article-title><source>M&#x000e9;d Trop</source><year>1943</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>273</fpage><lpage>277</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kivits</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Quatre cas d'enc&#x000e9;phalite mortelle avec invasion du liquide c&#x000e9;phalo-rachidien par <italic>Microfilaria loa</italic></article-title><source>Ann Soc Belg M&#x000e9;d Trop</source><year>1952</year><volume>32</volume><fpage>235</fpage><lpage>242</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gallais</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Collomb</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Guedel</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Les manifestations neuro-psychiques des filarioses</article-title><source>M&#x000e9;d Trop</source><year>1954</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>663</fpage><lpage>677</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Carayon</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Collomb</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Sankal&#x000e9;</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Du polymorphisme des complications neuro-psychiques des filarioses (A propos de quatre observations personnelles dont deux in&#x000e9;dites)</article-title><source>Bull Soc M&#x000e9;d Afr Noire Lgue Fr</source><year>1959</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>299</fpage><lpage>312</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cauchie</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Rutsaert</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Thys</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Bonnyns</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Perrier</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Enc&#x000e9;phalite &#x000e0; Loa-loa, trait&#x000e9;e par l'association de cortisone et de carbamazine</article-title><source>Rev Belg Pathol Med Exp</source><year>1965</year><volume>31</volume><fpage>232</fpage><lpage>244</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">5837048</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Same Ekobo</surname><given-names/></name><name><surname>Same-Voisin</surname><given-names/></name><name><surname>Eben-Moussi</surname><given-names/></name><name><surname>Ongmagne</surname><given-names/></name></person-group><article-title>A propos d'un cas de m&#x000e9;ningo-enc&#x000e9;phalite filarienne &#x000e0; <italic>Loa loa</italic>. Rappels des crit&#x000e8;res de diagnostic de certitude</article-title><source>Afr M&#x000e9;d</source><year>1981</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>359</fpage><lpage>361</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Negesse</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Lanoie</surname><given-names>LO</given-names></name><name><surname>Ne